  "description": "Hwang-soo’s gambling problem cost him everything, including his house and his farm. With the family on the verge of becoming homeless, Hwang-soo’s wife Mijah and daughter Danbi ask Dooshik, a wealthy man, for his help. But it turns out that the man they thought was a philanthropist, was actually someone quite villainous. After forcing her to sign a contract, Mijah finds out Dooshik was the one who had coerced the family into losing everything. Can Mijah and Danbi get their house back? Why did Dooshik target Hwang-soo in the first place? And will everyone's greed for money and lust for sex eventually catch up to them...?\n\n(Source: Lezhin X)",
